Z||000004||pHoOl||10-08-2001||04:29 PM||||I've always thought it'd be cool to put hydros on the fiero.  Like you said, not for jumping, but to raise and lower for diff conditions.  Like if you're not in michigan lower it to an inch while driving.  Then to get out, jack it on up.<P>As for airbags, i think it would be pretty hard to get funtional airbags into a fiero.  There is a lot of engineering work that goes into them, it's not like dropping on a spoiler.  i could imagine adding aftermarket to a firebird, cause you could probably get all the parts and computers and sensors that were in a similar firebird, but as for the fiero, prolly not.<P>------------------<BR>Rice mobiles are like tampons... Every p@#%y has one.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>        <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/phoolsig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
